<title>USA: Asia Pulp &amp; Paper at 10-5/8 in New York.</title>
<headline>Asia Pulp &amp; Paper at 10-5/8 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian Pulp &amp; Paper closed at 10-5/8 in New York on Thursday. It recorded the day's low of 10-1/2 and the day's high of 10-3/4.</p>
<p>Volume was 8,100 American Depository Shares. Block volume was nil. Its previous close on Wednesday was 10-1/2.</p>
<p>One ADS represents four common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
